type: other
abstract: >-
  A theoretical information-theoretic framework separates generative proposal
  uncertainty from context-dependent biological realization uncertainty in
  synthetic gene-circuit design. Numerical examples are explicitly synthetic
  and do not establish experimental performance.
keywords:
  - synthetic biology
  - information theory
  - generative models
  - gene regulatory circuits
  - uncertainty quantification
